[00:00.00]
[00:33.11]"You can rest now", you say
[00:38.63]Thinking back, it was a sweet trap

[00:47.04]Today I'll act as my ideal person, too
[00:53.55]Fiction, false words, false image, open mind.
[00:57.04]I made it myself

[01:01.09]The honest person is the boy who cried wolf
[01:06.37]It's about time for the liar to play the victim with those fake tears
[01:15.79]Aah, to run away from this kind of 3D world...
[01:23.03]you've decided, haven't you?

[01:23.77]「To virtualize a lie」
[01:25.79]Unscientific situations and imaginary speech-
[01:29.54]Hey, anything is fine
[01:31.85]Give me love
[01:33.85]Please love me
[01:35.63]Words can no longer heal me
[01:39.36]Please stay by my side a little longer; These were proof that my life wasn't enough.
[01:43.62]Scars, scars
[01:45.28]Please. stand in front of me, my doppelgänger in the mirror
[01:55.36]
[02:11.25]There had never been anything so fragile before
[02:14.92]Everything being fictional is fine
[02:18.49]Then, I want to close my eyes
[02:22.57]Right?

[02:24.37]LaLaLa......
[02:40.34]

[02:42.45]I lurched forward beside the scale
[02:45.87]And I laugh at myself, there's no place for me anymore
[02:49.39]Even if I want to go back, I can't return
[02:53.04]I didn't even realize
[02:56.42]The weight of that single words
[02:59.97]Become my sacrifice. 
[03:04.45]Where has my ideal reflection gone?

[03:10.29]With a completely different appearance
[03:14.34]You gave me a fake smile

[03:22.46]You're going to soak up lies, and spit out new ones, aren't you?
[03:29.82]I'm nothing more than a vessel I can't become that person
[03:33.22]That ideal reflection I created
[03:45.42]
[03:51.01]I wanted to break it
[03:52.83]But, I couldn't destroy it
[03:54.38]My ideal reflection isn't here
[03:58.22]Meaninglessly, I held out my hand
[04:05.84]Into the depths of the mirror

[04:08.68]「To virtualize a lie」
[04:10.61]An unrealistic situations
[04:12.41]A reflection that isn't there
[04:14.33]The disappearing boundary
[04:16.75]Give it back, come back
[04:20.48]I want to try one more time
[04:24.20]The real one is right here.
[04:26.35]That one's wrong, wrong, wrong, it's wrong
[04:29.07]Don't love the illusion of me. Please, don't forget me
[04:33.86]I swear I'll give it more thought

[04:39.83]"I won't lie to you again. You have my word"
[04:57.88]